  "summary": "An independent standard-library financial model now predicts exact balances, versions, durable outcomes and journals before commands run. Five seeded sequences cover transfers in both directions, rejected/replayed/conflicting intents, dual-reviewed funding, approved exact corrections, lost caller results, pre-commit rollback and four-way duplicate concurrency. Every step checks database balances, versions, balanced journals and immutable old records through a restricted API workload login. The guarded R07 host harness now has a fixed model profile and bounded counterexample replay. The minimizer and reproducible seed/operation records are retained.",
